        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn IW2BD / IW2BI, Egg Knob 16\" Mortise Cylinder Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional styling of Acorn's Mortise Cylinder Locket can be seen in every detail from the egg knob interior trim, to the black iron finish. This entryset is crafted by skilled artisans, using old world techniques of the hammer and anvil. Egg Knob 16\" Mortise Cylinder Handleset is available in either single cylinder or dummy functions for doors 1-3/4\" to 3\" thick with 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/forged-iron-egg-knob-acorn-iuqbd\"><b>Forged Iron Egg Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Egg Knob 16\" Mortise Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>The deadbolt is made of brass with hardened steel inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a knob from both the exterior and the interior. Panic Proof: Turning of inside knob will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the knob. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Egg Knob 16 Inch Mortise Cylinder Handleset, Acorn IW2BD / IW2BI",
                "description": "Egg Knob 16 Inch Mortise Cylinder Lockset Acorn IW2BI - The traditional styling of Acorn's Mortise Cylinder Locket can be seen in every detail from the egg knob interior trim, to the black iron finish. This entryset is crafted by skilled artisans, using old world techniques of the hammer and anvil. Egg Knob 16 Inch Mortise Cylinder Handleset is available in either single cylinder or dummy functions for doors 1-3/4 to 3 inches inches thick with 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "Single cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Mortise Cylinder entrysets, Acorn mortise lock handlesets, mortise handlesets,  Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder locksets, traditional handlesets, arched handlesets, Acorn IW2BI, Acorn IW2BD, ACO-IW2BI, Egg Knob 16 Inch Mortise Cylinder Locksets, Egg Knob 16 Inch Mortise Cylinder Handlesets, Acorn IW2BD / IW2BI"
